# Per-user local working directory (audits, scratch, drafts, temp artifacts).
# AI agents that follow AGENTS.md treat this as the place to write run-time data.
/.local

# Local-only SOW working memory: SOW documents and specs. Never committed. The
# trailing-slash pattern ignores every subdirectory, keeping the framework
# files (SOW.template.md, audit.sh) tracked.
/.agents/sow/*/

# Per-user secrets and pointers consumed by AI-skill scripts.
/.env
